          <span style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">🛬 <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Regreso:</strong> 26 Abr al 2 May</span>
          <span style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">💰 <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Tope:</strong> US$ 2.400</span>
          <span style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">⏱️ <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Escalas:</strong> Máx 1</span>
        </div>
